{"id":"4b8ff6bb58783a25","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension.md","title":"Cantor 空间经典 Hausdorff 维数","display":"df-classical-hausdorff-dimension — Cantor 空间经典 Hausdorff 维数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension","aliases":["43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension"],"display":"df-classical-hausdorff-dimension — Cantor 空间经典 Hausdorff 维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Defs.17.1.1,17.1.3, printed pp.512–513 / PDF pp.532–533","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classical-hausdorff-dimension — Cantor 空间经典 Hausdorff 维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Defs.17.1.1,17.1.3, printed pp.512–513 / PDF pp.532–533"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^\\omega\\times2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^\\omega\\times2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 由下式定义。柱集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>；非负扩展实数上的确界采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty\">\\(\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\varnothing=0\">\\(\\sup\\varnothing=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;X=Y,\\\\2^{-\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:X(j)\\ne Y(j)\\}},&amp;X\\ne Y.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;X=Y,\\\\2^{-\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:X(j)\\ne Y(j)\\}},&amp;X\\ne Y.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H^s_n(E)\\coloneqq\\inf\\left\\{\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D}2^{-s|\\sigma|}:D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land E\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in D}[\\sigma]\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;|\\sigma|\\ge n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H^s_n(E)\\coloneqq\\inf\\left\\{\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D}2^{-s|\\sigma|}:D\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land E\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in D}[\\sigma]\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;|\\sigma|\\ge n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H^s(E)\\coloneqq\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal H^s_n(E),\\qquad\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\\mathcal H^s(E)=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H^s(E)\\coloneqq\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal H^s_n(E),\\qquad\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\\mathcal H^s(E)=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补建原 point-to-set 节点悬空的经典维数。空集取0，全部空间取1；覆盖允许任意串集合，区别于有效覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$d:2^\\omega\\times2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 由下式定义。柱集 $[\\sigma]$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]；非负扩展实数上的确界采用 $\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$、$\\sup\\varnothing=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d:2^\\omega\\times2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\varnothing=0","display":false},{"tex":"d(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&X=Y,\\\\2^{-\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:X(j)\\ne Y(j)\\}},&X\\ne Y.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H^s_n(E)\\coloneqq\\inf\\left\\{\\sum_{\\sigma\\in D}2^{-s|\\sigma|}:D\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\land E\\subseteq\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in D}[\\sigma]\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;|\\sigma|\\ge n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H^s(E)\\coloneqq\\sup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal H^s_n(E),\\qquad\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathrm H}(E)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}:\\mathcal H^s(E)=0\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1635,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-418","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]] — Cantor 空间经典 Hausdorff 维数"},{"id":"2795abfc568c9162","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]、[[43-df-box-counting-dimension]]。"},{"id":"1ff681397acc990c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\subseteq2^\\omega$；经典 Cantor Hausdorff 维数见 [[43-df-classical-hausdorff-dimension]]，相对有效维数见 [[43-df-reldim]]；对 $E=\\varnothing$ 约定非负值的 $\\sup\\varnothing=0$。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}